  "is": "The biryani of Hyderabad, made the kacchi way: raw lamb marinated for a long time in spiced yogurt, mint and crisp fried onion is layered with basmati rice that is boiled only until nearly tender, then sealed in a heavy pot with a rope of dough and cooked in its own steam, so that the meat and the rice finish together. Rose water and saffron milk scent the top. It differs from a chicken biryani in the meat, the long marinade and the raw meat going into the pot.",
